  "description": "Digital signatures for DocWright: Office package signature verification with per-part results, so you learn which part broke a signature and not merely that something did, plus package signing and PDF signatures written as an incremental update. Signing goes through a provider you implement, so DocWright never holds a private key and never decides trust — HSM, KMS and smart-card scenarios stay possible.",
